{"seq":35,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a2155"},"reason":"Flagstaff's 2001 designation was 'International Dark Sky City' (the NPS and High Country News both say so); the category is now called Dark Sky Community. The sentence now says the title's 2001 name in all three languages.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.nps.gov/waca/learn/news/flagstaff-international-dark-sky-parks.htm"},{"url":"https://www.hcn.org/issues/issue-216/stargazers-defend-darkness-in-arizona/"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",598],["+","– in 2001 the title "],["=",2],["+","still \"International Dark Sky City\" – was "],["=",193]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",574],["+","– 2001 hieß der Titel noch „International Dark Sky City“ – "],["=",177]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",562],["+","— в 2001 году звание ещё называлось «Международный город тёмного неба» (International Dark Sky City) — "],["=",205]]}],"hash":"11b76a1e8aa8","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"6e57203dd7285c25dba2c669e973edb7ae8b3d5d67e2b43881e70572f9f3fab5"},
